      "title": "PROPOSED \u00b7 2026-10-17 \u00b7 ENG-84",
      "content": "Five tables / 31 fields. Not applied to any database.\n\nNo foreign keys are proposed. Moderation and logs can exist before a student profile.\n\nReview: remove five old log fields only after archiving values and retiring old readers/writers.\n\nKeep separate dev and production databases. RLS, API grants, backups and cutover are separate work in ENG-86/87.",
